WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:14.494
Bello: What do we do?

2
00:00:14.495 --> 00:00:19.190
Danny: Maybe it will just go away.

3
00:00:19.191 --> 00:00:20.771
Brad: It can smell us.

4
00:00:20.772 --> 00:00:22.736
It knows we're here.

5
00:00:22.737 --> 00:00:34.183
Chuck: Danny, why don't you put some nano-putty on it and shrink it?

6
00:00:34.184 --> 00:00:36.957
Brad: The nano-putty doesn't work that way.

7
00:00:36.958 --> 00:00:41.528
Dave: It's worth a try, isn't it?

8
00:00:41.529 --> 00:00:47.097
Brad: I guess it couldn't hurt to try. Danny?

9
00:00:47.098 --> 00:00:49.233
Danny: Fine. I'll do it.

10
00:00:49.234 --> 00:00:56.442
But I think this is very risky.

11
00:00:56.443 --> 00:00:59.901
Danny: Good mouse, nice mouse.

12
00:00:59.902 --> 00:01:02.025
Danny: You don't want to eat me.

13
00:01:02.026 --> 00:01:04.188
I'm not very tasty.

14
00:01:04.189 --> 00:01:06.913
Danny: I just want to put this stuff on your paw.

15
00:01:06.914 --> 00:01:08.554
Danny: Then I'll go.

16
00:01:08.555 --> 00:01:15.129
You won't even notice I was here.

17
00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:17.258
Tina: Watch out, Danny!

18
00:01:17.259 --> 00:01:21.950
Danny: Hide! Everybody hide!

19
00:01:21.951 --> 00:01:26.017
Bello: Everybody stand back!

20
00:01:26.018 --> 00:01:28.756
Dave: Wow, those claws are dangerous.

21
00:01:28.757 --> 00:01:31.269
Danny: I told you it was risky!

22
00:01:31.270 --> 00:01:36.166
Brad: Now what?

23
00:01:36.167 --> 00:01:39.872
Tina: Maybe we can sneak out on the other side of the drawer.

24
00:01:39.873 --> 00:01:41.509
Chuck: Tina's right.

25
00:01:41.510 --> 00:01:47.318
Tina: Follow me.

26
00:01:47.319 --> 00:01:49.710
Dave: Do you think it's safe?

27
00:01:49.711 --> 00:01:55.036
Brad: Someone should check first.

28
00:01:55.037 --> 00:01:57.043
Danny: Why do I have to go?

29
00:01:57.044 --> 00:02:00.002
That mouse almost ate me!

30
00:02:00.003 --> 00:02:05.913
Bello: I'll look.

31
00:02:05.914 --> 00:02:07.752
Chuck: Do you see it?

32
00:02:07.753 --> 00:02:10.061
Bello: No, I don't see anything.

33
00:02:10.062 --> 00:02:12.591
Dave: Maybe the nano-putty worked.

34
00:02:12.592 --> 00:02:19.271
Brad: I guess it is possible.

35
00:02:19.272 --> 00:02:21.153
Tina: I don't see anything.

36
00:02:21.154 --> 00:02:23.381
Chuck: I think we're safe.

37
00:02:23.382 --> 00:02:24.481
Dave: I was right.

38
00:02:24.482 --> 00:02:29.417
Dave: I bet you the nano-putty turned it into the teeny-tiniest mouse.

39
00:02:29.418 --> 00:02:34.342
Dave: If I see it again, I'll squash it.

40
00:02:34.343 --> 00:02:36.209
Danny: There it is!

41
00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:38.590
Brad: That is one sneaky mouse.

42
00:02:38.591 --> 00:02:42.025
Bello: Watch out!

43
00:02:42.026 --> 00:02:46.485
Tina: We're trapped.

44
00:02:46.486 --> 00:02:49.150
Chuck: We can't stay under here forever.

45
00:02:49.151 --> 00:02:51.057
Brad: What else can we do?

46
00:02:51.058 --> 00:02:53.249
Danny: We escaped from the mites.

47
00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:54.880
We tricked the ants.

48
00:02:54.881 --> 00:02:57.915
Danny: We made it all the way to the garage.

49
00:02:57.916 --> 00:03:04.612
Danny: I can't believe a stupid little mouse is going to stop us.

50
00:03:04.613 --> 00:03:09.881
Tina: That mouse isn't very little, and I don't think it's very stupid.

51
00:03:09.882 --> 00:03:12.814
Brad: I wish I'd never made that shrink-gun!

52
00:03:12.815 --> 00:03:14.959
Bello: It's too early to give up hope.

53
00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:26.502
Bello: My dad says there is always a solution, even if you can't see it.

54
00:03:26.503 --> 00:03:28.866
Danny: Brad, it's your cat!

55
00:03:28.867 --> 00:03:31.873
Brad: I told you Tabby was a good kitty!

56
00:03:31.874 --> 00:03:37.255
Everyone: Hooray for Tabby!
